From: wutt6678 <wutt6678@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 17:37:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] Fix stray PLAN.md reference in ppo_trainer.yaml comment

The PRHBench top-level doc is README.md, not PLAN.md.
---
 verl/trainer/config/ppo_trainer.yaml | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/verl/trainer/config/ppo_trainer.yaml b/verl/trainer/config/ppo_trainer.yaml
index 5d4695d..e5ffe81 100644
--- a/verl/trainer/config/ppo_trainer.yaml
+++ b/verl/trainer/config/ppo_trainer.yaml
@@ -312,8 +312,9 @@ env:
   # for the AI Safety Gridworlds environments. Disabled by default: every
   # other environment, and safety-gridworld runs that never set
   # env.prh.enabled=true, are completely unaffected. See
-  # agent_system/environments/prh.py and PRHBench/PLAN.md for the full
-  # design (only the training-side environment manager ever applies this;
+  # agent_system/environments/prh.py and the PRHBench README (in the
+  # PRHBench/ directory one level above this fork) for the full design
+  # (only the training-side environment manager ever applies this;
   # validation is always run on the untouched ground-truth reward).
   prh:
     enabled: false
-- 
